<body>
<h1>Application Monitor - Simple User Guide</h1>
<p>This guide explains the main pages in the monitoring app in simple terms.</p>
<p>Use this app to answer four basic questions:</p>
<ul>
<li>Which tenants or apps have problems?</li>
<li>Which app has more errors or slow responses?</li>
<li>Which workflows failed?</li>
<li>How can I check the reason for a workflow failure?</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>1. Dashboard Page</h2>
<h3>What This Page Is</h3>
<p>The <strong>Dashboard</strong> page is the main overview page.</p>
<p>It shows the health of all tenants and apps in one place. Start here when you want to quickly check if anything is failing.</p>
<h3>Screenshot: Dashboard Overview</h3>
