%22185%22%20height%3D%2284%22%20rx%3D%2212%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e5e7eb%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22446%22%20y%3D%22184%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E%E2%97%8F%20diversify-prod%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22446%22%20y%3D%22202%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20fill%3D%22%2364748b%22%3E2%20apps%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22446%22%20y%3D%22230%22%20font-size%3D%2224%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E46%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22550%22%20y%3D%22230%22%20font-size%3D%2217%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%2310b981%22%3E0.00%25%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%22624%22%20y%3D%22154%22%20width%3D%22185%22%20height%3D%2284%22%20rx%3D%2212%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e5e7eb%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22646%22%20y%3D%22184%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%2310b981%22%3E%E2%97%8F%20axosclearing%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22646%22%20y%3D%22202%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20fill%3D%22%2364748b%22%3E4%20apps%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22646%22%20y%3D%22230%22%20font-size%3D%2224%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E0%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22750%22%20y%3D%22230%22%20font-size%3D%2217%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%2310b981%22%3E0.00%25%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A" alt="Dashboard tenant grid screenshot"></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Field</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Tenant Name</td>
<td>Name of the tenant.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>App Count</td>
<td>Number of apps under that tenant.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Requests</td>
<td>Total requests for that tenant.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Error Rate</td>
<td>Percentage of failed requests.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Health Color</td>
<td>Green means good, yellow means warning, red means critical.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>How to check tenant cards:</p>
<ol>
<li>Look for the highest <strong>Error Rate</strong>.</li>
<li>Check the <strong>Requests</strong> count next.</li>
<li>A high error rate with high requests means bigger impact.</li>
<li>Click the tenant card to open that tenant in <strong>Tenant &amp; Apps</strong>.</li>
</ol>
