ze%3D%2214%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%23ef4444%22%3E9.98%25%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2244%22%20y%3D%22244%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E%E2%97%8F%20Financial%20Reporting%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2260%22%20y%3D%22264%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20fill%3D%22%2394a3b8%22%3EProduction%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22236%22%20y%3D%22230%22%20width%3D%2260%22%20height%3D%2224%22%20rx%3D%227%22%20fill%3D%22%23fef2f2%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fecaca%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22248%22%20y%3D%22247%22%20font-size%3D%2214%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%23ef4444%22%3E0.00%25%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2244%22%20y%3D%22286%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E%E2%97%8F%20Journal%20Voucher%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2260%22%20y%3D%22306%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20fill%3D%22%2394a3b8%22%3EProduction%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22236%22%20y%3D%22272%22%20width%3D%2260%22%20height%3D%2224%22%20rx%3D%227%22%20fill%3D%22%23fef2f2%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fecaca%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22248%22%20y%3D%22289%22%20font-size%3D%2214%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%23ef4444%22%3E0.00%25%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A" alt="Dashboard tenant hover popover screenshot"></p>
<p>Hovering over a tenant shows the top apps contributing to that tenant&#39;s errors.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Field</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>App name</td>
<td>App inside the tenant.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Environment</td>
<td>Environment where that app is running.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Error rate</td>
<td>Failure percentage for that app.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>How to use it:</p>
<ol>
<li>Hover over a tenant with a high error rate.</li>
<li>Find the app with the highest error rate.</li>
<li>Click the app row to open <strong>Application Insights</strong> directly.</li>
</ol>
<h3>How to Use the Dashboard</h3>
<ol>
<li>Open <strong>Dashboard</strong>.</li>
<li>Select the required <strong>Date Range</strong>.</li>
<li>Select the required <strong>Environment</strong>.</li>
<li>Look at <strong>Total Errors</strong> and <strong>Error Rate</strong>.</li>
<li>Check the tenant cards and leaderboards.</li>
<li>Click a tenant or app to see more details.</li>
</ol>
<h3>Leaderboards</h3>
<p>The dashboard has leaderboards to show the worst-performing apps first.</p>
