rate%20with%20135%20total%20requests%20failing%2C%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22208%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2216%22%20fill%3D%22%231f2937%22%3Eall%20returning%20404%20route_not_found%20errors.%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22250%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%236b7280%22%3EROOT%20CAUSE%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22278%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2216%22%20fill%3D%22%231f2937%22%3EBetween%202026-05-06T16%3A00%20and%2016%3A15%2C%20routing%20failed%20with%20100%25%20of%20requests%20returning%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22302%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2216%22%20fill%3D%22%231f2937%22%3E404%20route_not_found.%20Requests%20are%20rejected%20at%20the%20ingress%2Frouting%20layer%20before%20reaching%20pods.%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22344%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%236b7280%22%3EEVIDENCE%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2238%22%20y%3D%22374%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%23374151%22%3E%E2%80%A2%20100%25%20error%20rate%20across%20135%20requests%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2238%22%20y%3D%22402%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%23374151%22%3E%E2%80%A2%20All%20errors%20are%20404%20route_not_found%20with%200ms%20duration%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2238%22%20y%3D%22430%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%23374151%22%3E%E2%80%A2%20No%205xx%20errors%2C%20suggesting%20backend%20may%20be%20healthy%20but%20unreachable%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22474%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2213%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%236b7280%22%3EWHAT%20TO%20CHECK%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2238%22%20y%3D%22502%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%23374151%22%3E1.%20Verify%20istio-ingress%20routing%20configuration%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2238%22%20y%3D%22530%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%23374151%22%3E2.%20Check%20pod%20restarts%20during%20the%20incident%20window%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%2220%22%20y%3D%22552%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%2254%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%23ecfdf5%22%20stroke%3D%22%2386efac%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2236%22%20y%3D%22584%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%231f2937%22%3ESuggested%20fix%3A%20restore%20VirtualService%20routing%20rules%20and%20reload%20ingress%20pods%20if%20needed.%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A" alt="Dashboard critical incident summary screenshot"></p>
<p>Some dashboard rows can open an incident-style analysis modal.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Section</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Error summary</td>
<td>Short description of the issue.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Root cause</td>
<td>Why the app is likely failing.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Evidence</td>
<td>Facts used to support the analysis.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Impact</td>
<td>Business or user impact.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>What to check</td>
<td>Actions to validate the issue.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Suggested fix</td>
<td>Recommended fix.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Confidence</td>
<td>How confident the analysis is.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>How to use it:</p>
<ol>
<li>Read <strong>Error summary</strong> first.</li>
<li>Read <strong>Root cause</strong>.</li>
<li>Check <strong>Evidence</strong> to confirm the conclusion.</li>
<li>Follow <strong>What to check</strong> before applying the suggested fix.</li>
</ol>
