<p>How to check apps in a tenant:</p>
<ol>
<li>Open <strong>Tenant &amp; Apps</strong>.</li>
<li>Click the tenant.</li>
<li>Check the summary cards at the top.</li>
<li>Use <strong>Critical</strong> or <strong>Warning</strong> filters if there are issues.</li>
<li>On each app card, check <strong>Total Requests</strong>, <strong>Error Rate</strong>, <strong>P95 Latency</strong>, and <strong>Health</strong>.</li>
<li>Click <strong>View details</strong> to open <strong>Application Insights</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<p>Click an app card to open <strong>Application Insights</strong>.</p>
<hr>
<h2>3. Application Insights Page</h2>
<h3>What This Page Is</h3>
<p>The <strong>Application Insights</strong> page shows details for one selected app.</p>
<p>Use this page to understand how one app is performing.</p>
