<p>The <strong>Errors</strong> chart shows how many requests failed.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Axis</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>X axis</td>
<td>Time.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Y axis</td>
<td>Number of errors.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>How to check:</p>
<ol>
<li>Look for the highest error spike.</li>
<li>Hover on the spike to see the time and error count.</li>
<li>Click the spike or switch to <strong>List</strong> view and click that time row to see error samples.</li>
<li>Note the time, then check <strong>Workflow Analysis</strong> for failed workflows around that same time.</li>
</ol>
