20documents%20from%20primary%20owner%20taxid%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22470%22%20y%3D%22215%22%20fill%3D%22%231d4ed8%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3EJiffy_435826067%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22610%22%20y%3D%22215%22%20fill%3D%22%2364748b%22%3EWorkflow%20execution%20failure%20WorkflowId%3D'Jiffy_...%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22900%22%20y%3D%22215%22%3E6%2F5%2F2026%2C%209%3A39%3A21%20am%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%221070%22%20y%3D%22198%22%20width%3D%22108%22%20height%3D%2228%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff7ed%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fdba74%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%221090%22%20y%3D%22217%22%20fill%3D%22%23ea580c%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E%E2%8C%95%20Investigate%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cline%20x1%3D%2236%22%20y1%3D%22234%22%20x2%3D%221180%22%20y2%3D%22234%22%20stroke%3D%22%23f1f5f9%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%2248%22%20y%3D%22265%22%20fill%3D%22%2394a3b8%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E03%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2292%22%20y%3D%22265%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3EGet%20Memos%20Sorted%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22470%22%20y%3D%22265%22%20fill%3D%22%231d4ed8%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3EJiffy_961195326%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22610%22%20y%3D%22265%22%20fill%3D%22%2364748b%22%3EWorkflow%20execution%20failure%20WorkflowId%3D'Jiffy_...%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22900%22%20y%3D%22265%22%3E5%2F5%2F2026%2C%209%3A55%3A05%20pm%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%221070%22%20y%3D%22248%22%20width%3D%22108%22%20height%3D%2228%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff7ed%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fdba74%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%221090%22%20y%3D%22267%22%20fill%3D%22%23ea580c%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%3E%E2%8C%95%20Investigate%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A" alt="Workflow 5xx table screenshot"></p>
<p>The <strong>5xx Errors</strong> view shows failed workflows that had server-side failures.</p>
<p>Use this when the app has backend errors or the API Failures section shows 5xx errors.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Field</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
<th>How to Check</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Process Name</td>
<td>Workflow process that failed.</td>
<td>Look for repeated process names.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Workflow ID</td>
<td>Unique ID of the failed workflow.</td>
<td>Copy this when reporting the issue.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Error</td>
<td>Short error message.</td>
<td>Read this for the first clue.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Time</td>
<td>Failure or execution time.</td>
<td>Match this with charts and logs.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Investigate</td>
<td>Opens detailed investigation.</td>
<td>Click this for root cause and logs.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>How to check 5xx failures:</p>
<ol>
<li>Click <strong>5xx Errors</strong>.</li>
<li>Look for repeated process names.</li>
<li>Look for repeated error messages.</li>
<li>Click <strong>Investigate</strong> on the most recent or most repeated failure.</li>
<li>Check the root cause, failure chain, and evidence logs.</li>
</ol>
