%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3Eo%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22920%22%20y%3D%22151%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2218%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%231e1b4b%22%3Eops%40jiffy.ai%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%22845%22%20y%3D%22190%22%20width%3D%22355%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22225%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%234f46e5%22%3EUSER-AGENT%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22245%22%20font-family%3D%22Courier%20New%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%3EMozilla%2F5.0%20(Windows%20NT%2010.0%3B%20Win64%3B%20x64)%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22285%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%234f46e5%22%3EENVIRONMENT%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22305%22%20font-family%3D%22Courier%20New%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%3Edevelop%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22345%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%2392400e%22%3EREQUEST%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22365%22%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%2228%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8fafc%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e5e7eb%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22365%22%20width%3D%2255%22%20height%3D%2228%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%23dbeafe%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22878%22%20y%3D%22384%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%231d4ed8%22%3EPOST%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22935%22%20y%3D%22384%22%20font-family%3D%22Courier%20New%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%3Ehttps%3A%2F%2Fnewui-paidloan...%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22425%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%2392400e%22%3EHEADERS%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%22865%22%20y%3D%22440%22%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%2280%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%23fffbeb%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fde68a%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A" alt="Workflow flow screenshot"></p>
<p>The workflow flow visualizer shows how the workflow moved between steps.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Area</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
<th>How to Check</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Workflow Flow title</td>
<td>Workflow ID and number of steps.</td>
<td>Confirm you are viewing the correct workflow.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Triggered by</td>
<td>User or system that started the workflow.</td>
<td>Check who initiated the run.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Step boxes</td>
<td>Workflow steps that ran.</td>
<td>Follow the arrows from start to end.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Duration</td>
<td>Time taken by each step.</td>
<td>Long duration may indicate slowness.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Right panel</td>
<td>Request context, user agent, origin, environment, and request details.</td>
<td>Use this to understand how the workflow was triggered.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>How to use the flow:</p>
<ol>
<li>Start at the top trigger node.</li>
<li>Follow the arrows between workflow steps.</li>
<li>Check which step failed or took longer.</li>
<li>Open the right panel details to see request information.</li>
</ol>
